# Umbral Pass — dusky mountain trail from Dragonspire's south gate to the Prism Summit caves.
# Opened by the Clan guard once the player holds the Dusk Badge (flag p3b_badge8).
map umbral_pass
name "Umbral Pass"
location "Umbral Pass"
music route_late
environment grass
region 13 4
encounters p3b_umbral_pass
connect north dragonspire_city -6

